  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Southeast Asia Gender-Based Violence Prevention Platform 2024-29</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment comprises regional activities focused on the primary prevention of gender-based violence in Southeast Asia. The Southeast Asia Gender-based Violence Prevention Platform will improve regional capacity, coordination and collaborative action on gender-based violence prevention through evidence-based advocacy, dialogue, policy and practice.  Disability equity and inclusion are a significant priority for this investment and will be mainstreamed across Platform activities. Complementing the Platform is the UN Joint Programme on GBV Prevention delivered by UNFPA and UN Women (INO407 refers).</narrative>
  </description>
